 "words": 169,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Twelve men went out from the camp",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From the tribe of Issachar Igal came",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To scout the land from Zin to Rehob",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They cut a branch in the Valley of Eshcol",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty days they walked the ground",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And saw the cities fortified and strong",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The descendants of Anak lived there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We seemed like grasshoppers in their sight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people who live there are strong",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The cities are fortified and very large",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We cannot attack those people",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 15.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They are stronger than we are",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 12.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole congregation broke out in cry",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And wept through that long and heavy night",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why bring us to this land to die",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let us choose a leader and go back",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people who live there are strong",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The cities are fortified and very large",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We cannot attack those people",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They are stronger than we are",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Spreading a bad report on the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They made the congregation grumble and cry",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the Lord a plague fell down",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
